@startuml
title Roziyeva Yasmina - Strategy and Observer
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
abstract class Enemy <<Strategy Context>> {
  - behavior: BehaviorStrategy
  + setBehavior(behavior: BehaviorStrategy)
}
interface BehaviorStrategy <<Strategy>> {
  + desiredVelocity(enemy: Enemy, world: WorldView, dt: double): Vec2
}
class PatrolBehavior <<Concrete Strategy>>
class ChaseBehavior <<Concrete Strategy>>
class FleeBehavior <<Concrete Strategy>>
class IdleBehavior
class AiSystem {
  + update(world: World, view: WorldView, dt: double)
}
class ArenaRules <<Event Publisher>> {
  + applyCollisions(world, pairs, dt, tick)
}
class World <<Event Publisher>> {
  + commitChanges(tick: long)
}
interface GameEvent
class EventBus <<Subject>> {
  + subscribe(type, listener): Subscription
  + publish(event: GameEvent)
  + dispatchPending()
}
interface "GameEventListener<E extends GameEvent>" as Listener <<Observer>> {
  + onEvent(event: E)
}
interface Subscription {
  + close()
}
class HudObserver <<Concrete Observer>>
class EventLogObserver <<Concrete Observer>>
Enemy o--> BehaviorStrategy
AiSystem ..> Enemy : delegates velocity to behavior
BehaviorStrategy <|.. PatrolBehavior
BehaviorStrategy <|.. ChaseBehavior
BehaviorStrategy <|.. FleeBehavior
BehaviorStrategy <|.. IdleBehavior
ArenaRules --> EventBus : publish rule events
World --> EventBus : publish committed lifecycle events
EventBus --> GameEvent : queued immutable values
EventBus o--> Listener : active subscriptions
EventBus ..> Subscription : returns lifecycle handle
Subscription ..> EventBus : remove listener
Listener <|.. HudObserver
Listener <|.. EventLogObserver
note bottom of EventBus
Events are dispatched after commit.
Events emitted by a listener wait until the next update.
Scene exit closes subscriptions.
end note
@enduml
